---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/avatar.jpeg';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet"
	pubDate={new Date('February 11 2026')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		I’m a software engineer focused on infrastructure reliability, operational maturity, and failure-resistant system design.
	</p>
	<p>
		I care about what happens after launch when systems are under real load and mistakes become expensive.
	</p>

	<p>I work on problems like:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>Designing high-availability architectures</li>
		<li>Reducing deployment risk and blast radius</li>
		<li>Building incident response systems that actually work</li>
		<li>Monitoring and alerting that detects meaningful failure</li>
		<li>Operational philosophy, not just tooling</li>
	</ul>

	<p>
		Most software systems don’t fail because of a single bug. They fail because operational discipline doesn’t scale with growth. I focus on helping teams close that gap before it becomes visible to customers.
	</p>

	<p>
		If you're building something ambitious and want a second set of experienced eyes on your operational reliability, I occasionally advise teams on improving their infrastructure and processes.
	</p>

	<p>
		If you want to discuss infrastructure reliability or operational systems, feel free to get in touch.
	</p>
</Layout>
